                "loc": "REV.20.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kahi ya nyama osi a tsakani arioumbwa ni Mwenyezi Mlungu, nyoka ndiye yekala mlachu kuriko nyama anjina osi. Nyoka yamuuza yuya mchetu, “Hangbwe, Mlungu wakuambirani msirye matunda ga muhi wowosi muno mundani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya mchetu achiijibu yo nyoka achiiamba, “Hunaweza kurya matunda ga muhi wowosi phapha mundani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela Mlungu waamba, ‘Msirye matunda ga muhi urio kahi-kahi ya chunga wala msiugute, mana mchirya mundafwa.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyoka ichimuambira ye mchetu, “Kpweli tamundafwa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Mlungu anamanya kukala siku mndiphorya matunda ga muhi hinyo, mundangʼalwa ni matso dza iye mmanye manono na mai.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya mchetu ariphoona kukala nyo muhi una matunda manono ga kurya, na unatamanika kpwa kumupha mutu ikima. Phahi, wahunda matundage achirya, chisha achimupha mlumewe yekala a phamwenga, naye achirya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phapho kare angʼalwa ni matso, achidzimanya kukala a chitsaha, hipho ashona makodza ga muhi uihwao mtini, achivwala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iriphofika dziloni amsikira Mwenyezi Mlungu ananyendeka mo mundani. Yuya mutu na mchewe achidzifwitsa kahi ya mihi mo mundani ili Mwenyezi Mlungu asiaone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achimuiha yuya mutu achimuamba, “U kuphi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya mutu achijibu achiamba, “Nkasikira misindoyo unanyendeka mo mundani, nkaogopha, nkadzifwitsa mana ni chitsaha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achimuamba, “Ni ani achiyekuambira kukala u chitsaha? Ama ukarya go matunda ga muhi nriokukahaza usirye?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye mutu achiamba, “Ye mchetu uriyenipha nikale naye, ndiye achiyenipha ro tunda ra nyo muhi, nami nkarya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
