              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Mwenyezi Mlungu achiamba, “Sambi hiyu mwanadamu akakala dza swiswi, anamanya manono na mai. Husimriche akahunda matunda ga muhi wa uzima akarya, na akakala moyo hata kare na kare.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo, Mwenyezi Mlungu achimzola Adamu asikale mura munda wa Edeni, kpwa akarime tsi iyo ariyoumbirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphoazola, Mwenyezi Mlungu waika makerubi ko mlairo wa dzuwa wa Edeni. Chisha achiika upanga wa moho ugalukao hiku na hiku, ili kurinda njira iphiyayo kura kuriko na hura muhi wa uzima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.24"
            ]
          }
        }
